# The nose pop on the pad: both spin buttons together (L1 + R1; keys U + O; they cancel, so no spin) held
# as the ollie is let go pop off the nose like the nose button: a Nollie Kickflip.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
hold spinL+spinR 84..90
tap flip+left 96
run 300
expect event pop{nose=true} within 91..91
expect event comboLanded{name=Nollie Kickflip} within 160..240
expect no event bail
